'''Monsters''' refers to the many antagonistic creatures and entities Isaac can encounter throughout the game.

Most monsters (with few exceptions) damage Isaac by either touching him or shooting him with projectiles. Less frequently, monsters spawn additional, lesser monsters, spread [[creep]], or attempt to affect Isaac's movement. Some monsters have [[Stage HP|scaled health]] depending on which floor they're encountered. Along with the more common variety of monsters, [[Champions|champion]] versions can be found lurking about; these monsters are often like their common counterparts, but have a color tint or size change, more health, and drop basic [[pickup]]s on death. There are also champion versions of most [[bosses]].

There are 336 naturally spawning monsters in total. 40 of them were added in [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth|''Afterbirth'']], 21 were added in ''[[Afterbirth †]]'' (13 were added in [[Booster Pack]]s) and 140 were added in [[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance|''Repentance'']]. Almost all of these naturally spawning entities are featured in the {{dlc|a+}} [[Bestiary|Afterbirth+ Bestiary]] or {{dlc|r}} [[Bestiary Repentance|Repentance Bestiary]].

